{"source_record":3,"t":"2026-10-26T19:45:51.165Z","elapsed_s":3.343,"kind":"input","op":"tap","reaction":"A caretaker delivering to five flats, with a Sunday vote on my tea money. Rıza left me his notebook. That name rings a small bell: in Voice, Halil had a friend called Rıza in his goals panel. Low confidence, it is a common name. I will just continue.","game_clock":null,"engagement":null,"reason":null,"t_source_lexeme":"\"2026-10-26T19:45:51.165Z\"","elapsed_s_source_lexeme":"3.343","raw_line_sha256":"46770e1704ac46d6e0f5ce6817b0ab596ef9f406c1faea106ba176da3f15b8c4"}
{"source_record":4,"t":"2026-10-26T19:45:57.486Z","elapsed_s":9.664,"kind":"input","op":"shot","reaction":"Recognition guess at about 3s: Hacer in flat 1. In Voice, Hacer was the neighbour of Halil who stood at the door with him. Low-to-moderate confidence; same name, also a neighbour. Oh, Hacer, I hope it is you. Also Riza from the title. I want to see the building.","game_clock":"Monday 07:00","engagement":null,"reason":null,"t_source_lexeme":"\"2026-10-26T19:45:57.486Z\"","elapsed_s_source_lexeme":"9.664","raw_line_sha256":"303879244ac4cbb18c21c9eacbc8c9ad80260de9efa108df37450729cffa1c12"}
{"source_record":5,"t":"2026-10-26T19:46:02.790Z","elapsed_s":14.968,"kind":"input","op":"tap","reaction":"A lovely little drawn building with a stick figure in my room. Riza notes are in handwriting. Everyone says their order comes first, so before I run for bread I want to see all five orders.","game_clock":"Monday 07:03","engagement":null,"reason":null,"t_source_lexeme":"\"2026-10-26T19:46:02.790Z\"","elapsed_s_source_lexeme":"14.968","raw_line_sha256":"f24658f850ca81b26e52efcfdcb8196b1512bf353d9cce7c702581f7de610732"}
{"source_record":6,"t":"2026-10-26T19:46:05.771Z","elapsed_s":17.949,"kind":"input","op":"tap","reaction":"Five bread orders, all before nine, and reading pauses time, good. I do not know if I carry one order or all of them. Tarik is earliest and top floor. Going to the bakery.","game_clock":"Monday 07:06","engagement":null,"reason":null,"t_source_lexeme":"\"2026-10-26T19:46:05.771Z\"","elapsed_s_source_lexeme":"17.949","raw_line_sha256":"16bf9ad947408aa4cea0351645b1a2df9cde6dc11a1e75ca3270276ac6eba241"}
