{"source_record":8,"t":"2026-10-26T19:46:14.850Z","elapsed_s":27.028,"kind":"input","op":"tap","reaction":"Swap the newspapers of Hacer and Sevim? That is a strange little mischief button. I am curious who would notice, but on my first morning I do not want to play tricks. Taking the bread up to Tarik.","game_clock":"Monday 07:15","engagement":null,"reason":null,"t_source_lexeme":"\"2026-10-26T19:46:14.850Z\"","elapsed_s_source_lexeme":"27.028","raw_line_sha256":"bf48d12a6dca71eaaa94916e23c03461037f0f07115523f9a6a85a7160ac3cf1"}
