{"source_record":10,"t":"2026-10-26T19:46:22.935Z","elapsed_s":35.113,"kind":"input","op":"tap","reaction":"May your legs stay strong: that is a sweet thing to say to someone who just climbed four floors. And I can actually talk back, and time pauses while he talks. Anything new?","game_clock":"Monday 07:30","engagement":null,"reason":null,"t_source_lexeme":"\"2026-10-26T19:46:22.935Z\"","elapsed_s_source_lexeme":"35.113","raw_line_sha256":"99d88fbae67640eb3175e184f65b2bdebcb78c90630833c2bf9dc72ed4dbb21d"}
{"source_record":11,"t":"2026-10-26T19:46:26.185Z","elapsed_s":38.363,"kind":"input","op":"tap","reaction":"Gulls at five. A tiny line but it puts him on the top floor near the roof. Once a day for news, fair. Four others still want bread before eight-something, so I should not sit with him yet.","game_clock":"Monday 07:30","engagement":null,"reason":null,"t_source_lexeme":"\"2026-10-26T19:46:26.185Z\"","elapsed_s_source_lexeme":"38.363","raw_line_sha256":"8a86daec878c6114c51b730c92eaeb10811203da5e8a0b95cd7e91f65676f6ea"}
