{"source_record":14,"t":"2026-10-26T19:46:35.668Z","elapsed_s":47.846,"kind":"input","op":"tap","reaction":"Be careful around the cat, if there is a cat. Ha. She does not sound like the Hacer who sat in silence at the door with Halil; she sounds drier. Recognition still a guess, now weaker. She tipped me five lira.","game_clock":"Monday 07:33","engagement":null,"reason":null,"t_source_lexeme":"\"2026-10-26T19:46:35.668Z\"","elapsed_s_source_lexeme":"47.846","raw_line_sha256":"bf31ee5d1df29cfd3862884d493e999a4a6152b3a1f8c70a58a8f6a71d6781f7"}
