{"source_record":20,"t":"2026-10-26T19:46:51.929Z","elapsed_s":64.107,"kind":"first_minute","op":"log","reaction":"Just after sixty seconds. I am the new caretaker carrying the morning bread through a little drawn building; four of five loaves delivered, all on time so far. Each delivery opens a short conversation and time pauses while people talk. Now Sevim, who is not sure she trusts me, and Tell lets me pass on things I have heard, as I heard it or for certain, or make something up. I did not know I had heard that Hacer asks about private lives. This is the kind of thing I like: small words with consequences. I think Hacer and maybe Riza are names from Voice, but that is a guess.","game_clock":"Monday 07:35","engagement":null,"reason":null,"t_source_lexeme":"\"2026-10-26T19:46:51.929Z\"","elapsed_s_source_lexeme":"64.107","raw_line_sha256":"d480ce7b819e4cf024754f5f970e67cea91f36e96253b1b5a441118549d49aca"}
