{"source_record":22,"t":"2026-10-26T19:47:00.131Z","elapsed_s":72.309,"kind":"input","op":"tap","reaction":"I do not want to pass on gossip about Hacer to someone who does not trust me yet. Telling her Tarik is kind, for certain, because he blessed my legs. I want to see if kindness travels.","game_clock":"Monday 07:35","engagement":null,"reason":null,"t_source_lexeme":"\"2026-10-26T19:47:00.131Z\"","elapsed_s_source_lexeme":"72.309","raw_line_sha256":"5d619bcf674c32f05caceb202732621f52f9868d4142c357f63cdce5f46fceb1"}
